meta {
  name: List Orders
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/private/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  pageSize: 10
  ~sortBy: createdAt
  ~sortOrder: desc
  ~isCanceled: true
  ~userId: {{userId}}
  ~stripeId: cs_test_123
  ~paymentId: pi_test_123
  ~shippingTransactionId: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
}

docs {
  Requires an ADMIN session (run Public/Auth/Login (Admin) first). Anonymous -> 401, USER -> 403.

  Paginated envelope: { data, page, pageSize, total }. `total` reflects any applied filter.

  Sorting (toggle sortBy/sortOrder): sortBy in [createdAt, lastModifiedAt, isCanceled]; sortOrder in [asc, desc] (default asc). A sortBy outside the list -> 400.

  Filtering (toggle any, all AND-combined): isCanceled (bool), userId, stripeId, paymentId, shippingTransactionId (all exact). The legacy single-id filters are now combinable. Unknown filter keys are ignored.
}
